{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7eb22274a8eba5983d1a7aaeba23bb697b6e7b22659e0f1f69afc962f7283da8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"clawplays/ospec@be449f2ce698 snapshot 01de477712b27c38","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2cdd3d658bedcbc0d04777e615bc7f5ecc28dd60b643cd8c33a74da97598cf69","slc_f8f33bf31cb89f853b4326de044bd0a99cf056375c1e432413f305538bf673d9"],"source_ids":["src_6a6d0f85439757af8b29f8420861244e"],"text":"`ospec init` accepts flags such as --summary, --tech-stack, --architecture, and --document-language (en-US, zh-CN, ja-JP, or ar) to shape generated project docs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_818b2e2423704a6aa8bc647b2f92a136fed3b61fec1f2ded9796a5e8a5d51545","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"clawplays/ospec@be449f2ce698 snapshot 01de477712b27c38","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_083e29af666849fc7249b8c6f56f1b4408bb03579ef0f0202704abad251ebb9a"],"source_ids":["src_6a6d0f85439757af8b29f8420861244e"],"text":"The goal controller dispatches native subagents per harness (Codex spawn_agent with bounded waits, Claude Code background Task polling, Gemini @generalist, OpenCode @mention), with 60-second poll boundaries, heartbeats, and immediate persistence of completed children.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a796981ee60e84ca41e06fe59ad0621945c0365da6c8af536304782ca498ffc2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"clawplays/ospec@be449f2ce698 snapshot 01de477712b27c38","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_029d458c80c1f5cc3dfdf678d3e9564e4edc7457cc1bea4a4923f89a33d6dd73","slc_b208eb1ebbc0b88d90675f645a7f68739f0fad42bdc7a1c054f468689fe45387"],"source_ids":["src_6a6d0f85439757af8b29f8420861244e"],"text":"Loop commands manage concurrency and recovery: `ospec loop tick` issues task/final reviews bound to the real reviewer executor, `loop configure` sets concurrency/budgets/limits, and `loop recover --force` expires only unfinished items after confirmed session or child loss.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b52fcbb7b99b1bc58515ceead6317cd0a3060f04f6e44ed9472e6648124d892b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"clawplays/ospec@be449f2ce698 snapshot 01de477712b27c38","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2cdd3d658bedcbc0d04777e615bc7f5ecc28dd60b643cd8c33a74da97598cf69"],"source_ids":["src_6a6d0f85439757af8b29f8420861244e"],"text":"The chosen document language is persisted in .skillrc and reused for for-ai guidance, `ospec change`, and `ospec update`; CLI language resolution falls back through explicit flag, persisted settings, existing docs, then en-US.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_73fa9441626f4a07a562da7af5544053"}
